        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "The safety and effectiveness of rabeprazole sodium delayed-release tablets have been established in pediatric patients for adolescent patients 12 years of age and older for the treatment of symptomatic GERD.",
